<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτί-κολλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>close-glued, clinging
				close,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτίκολλος ὥστε τέκτονος χιτών,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτίως κολληθεὶς ὡς ὑπὸ
					τέκτονος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				768
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>fitting well together,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. συμβαίνει τάδε</span> turn out
				<i>exactly right,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				580
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀ. ἀγγέλου λόγον μαθεῖν</span>”
				<i>in the nick of time,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					373
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
